<title>CHINA: China cotton yield up by 6.6 pct in 1996.</title>
<headline>China cotton yield up by 6.6 pct in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's average cotton output per mu (0.0667 hectares) in 1996 rose to 59.3 kg from 52.4 kg in 1994, the Economic Information said on Monday.</p>
<p>It had increased by an average of 6.6 percent a year, it said.</p>
<p>Cotton output per mu in the main cotton producing region of Xinjiang was at 78.4 kg last year, it said.</p>
<p>-- Beijing Newsroom (8610) 6532 1921</p>
</text>
